usage: px-render.py [-h] [--shared SHARED] [--organized ORGANIZED] [--out OUT]
                    [--on-ratio ON_RATIO] [--seed SEED] [--title TITLE] [--subtitle SUBTITLE]
                    px

Render a Niagara Px as a self-contained HTML page.

positional arguments:
  px                    path to .px file (or 'selftest')

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --shared SHARED       station shared/ root (auto-detected if omitted)
  --organized ORGANIZED
                        organized/ corpus root for module:// resources (repo default)
  --out OUT             output .html path (default: stdout)
  --on-ratio ON_RATIO   demo fraction of relays ON (0..1)
  --seed SEED           demo-state seed tag (default: px basename)
  --title TITLE         page <title>
  --subtitle SUBTITLE   note line under the header
